      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13404/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place potatoes, onions, celery, and bouillon cubes in a large pot. Add enough water to cover all ingredients. Bring to a boil and simmer on medium heat for 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lyArr59DgJTqBCyfQM_xEc7Z_nI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13404-worlds-best-potato-soup-DDMFS-060-4x3-step-02-ad26721bdff441fd8a4ff99bd985b929.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13404/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add half and half, bacon, cream of mushroom soup and stir until combined. Add cheese and stir until completely melted. Simmer on low until potatoes are cooked through and tender.",
